@flexiarg musn/pattern-action-helper-command
@title Use Pattern-Action Helper Commands
@sigils [📥/力]
@audience fulab agents, musn server
@tone technical
@style pattern
@provenance no grounding source found for this pattern; deterministic search receipt: runs/L10-no-source-check.edn (L6-L10 sweep, 2026-09-05)

! conclusion: When logging pattern actions, use the pattern-action helper command.

  + context: Direct helper usage ensures reliable pattern-action RPC logs.

  + IF:
    The agent logs actions without using the helper command.

  + HOWEVER:
    The run still needs to proceed quickly.

  + THEN:
    Use `scripts/pattern-action read|implement|update <pattern-id> <note>` when needed.

  + BECAUSE:
    The helper ensures consistent RPC payloads and audit records.

  + NEXT-STEPS:
    - evidence: command_execution includes scripts/pattern-action for pattern actions.
    - evidence-shape: {:command :string, :exit_code :int}
